t</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">万象皆灰，唯理明畅</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Wànxiàng Jiē Huī, Wéi Lǐ Míngchàng</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">All Things Are Ashen, Only Reason Is Clear</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">萬象皆灰，唯理明暢</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Wànxiàng Jiē Huī, Wéi Lǐ Míngchàng</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">ついえし万象の灰と化せど</span> <span lang=\"ja\">理のみは通ず</span><br /><small><i>Tsuieshi Banshou no Hai to Kase do  Kotowari Nomi wa Tsuuzu&#8205;&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"&lt;sup&gt;&#91;!&#93;&lt;/sup&gt;\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\"><sup>[!]</sup></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Assumed reading</span></span>&#8205;</i></small></td><td>Even Though All Things Become Ashes, Only Reason Gets Through</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">스러져도</span> <span lang=\"ko\">명료한</span> <span lang=\"ko\">이치</span><br /><small><i>Seureojyeodo Myeongnyohan Ichi</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Obvi<span lang=\"es\">á</span>ndolo todo, ella se queda al margen</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>De tous les autres, elle ne prend aucune part</td><td>Of All Beside, She Takes No Part</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Остальное</span> <span lang=\"ru\">не</span> <span lang=\"ru\">заботит</span> <span lang=\"ru\">её</span><br /><small><i>Ostal'noye ne zabotit yeyo</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Of All Beside, She Takes No Part</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Vạn Vật Tro Tàn, Duy Lý Khai Sá